# 4-to-16 decoder: a Dec2 on the top two bits enables one of four Dec2.
chip Dec4
    in A0, A1, A2, A3, EN
    out Y0, Y1, Y2, Y3, Y4, Y5, Y6, Y7, Y8, Y9, Y10, Y11, Y12, Y13, Y14, Y15

    g0, g1, g2, g3 = Dec2(A2, A3, EN)
    Y0, Y1, Y2, Y3 = Dec2(A0, A1, g0)
    Y4, Y5, Y6, Y7 = Dec2(A0, A1, g1)
    Y8, Y9, Y10, Y11 = Dec2(A0, A1, g2)
    Y12, Y13, Y14, Y15 = Dec2(A0, A1, g3)
